# Describe the skills this robot offers to missions.
---
# JSON: skills with their args (type, format, enum, min and max, default_from, narrowed), the
# outputs they hand on, requires, effects, resources, idempotent, risk, max_duration_s, and the
# template: the ID of the skill's macro SubTree.
string catalog_json
# BehaviorTree.CPP's TreeNodesModel XML: the leaves' models, then a SubTree entry for each skill's
# macro. A mission may use only those SubTrees and the plain control nodes, never a leaf.
string tree_nodes_model_xml
string bt_cpp_version
# Changes whenever the catalog or the node model changes.
string catalog_version
